    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present Apartment 38, Brooklands, Nutley Lane, Dublin 4, to the market. Ideally positioned within this highly regarded development, this impressive two-bedroom ground-floor apartment offers well-proportioned accommodation, beautifully maintained communal gardens and the significant benefit of a car parking space.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hall, two spacious bedrooms with built-in wardrobes, a generous living room with feature fireplace and dining area, a separate kitchen and bathroom. Presented in excellent condition, the apartment would make an ideal home or an attractive investment opportunity.\n\nThe location is superb, with a wealth of amenities and recreational facilities close by. St Vincent's Hospital, Merrion Shopping Centre, UCD, RTE, St Michael's College, Blackrock College and Elm Park Golf & Sports Club are all within easy reach. Herbert Park, the RDS and Aviva Stadium are also nearby.\n\nExcellent transport links provide easy access to Dublin city centre, with numerous bus routes in the vicinity and Sydney Parade DART Station less than a 10-minute walk away.\n\nWith its excellent location, generous accommodation, parking and attractive communal surroundings, Apartment 38 presents an excellent opportunity in the heart of Dublin 4.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - \ntiled floor, intercom, large walk in storage press with fitted shelf and alarm panel. Hot press.\n\nBedroom 1 - \nspacious double bedroom with wood laminate flooring, large window, built in wadrobes\n\nBathroom - \nfully tiled floor and walls, shower over bath, large fitted mirror, w.h.b. and w.c.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nbright bedroom with large window and built in wardrobes\n\nLiving Room - \nopen plan living room and dining area. Laminate wood floor, built in storage. Open fireplace with marble surround. Double doors to patio terrace\n\nKitchen - \ntiled floor, fitted kitchen, tiled splash back, electric oven hob and extractor fan, window to side, plumbed for washing machine.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nPatio - \ntiled patio terrace surrounded by mature hedge and shrubs\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Excellent Location</li><li> Ideal home or investment</li><li> Turn key condition</li><li> Electric heating</li><li> Resident parking space</li><li> Service Charge 2,000 PA</ul>"
      },
